  "rationale": "Re-recorded from the merged tree. The refusal was provenance, not a metric breach: contentHash moved because this is the first tree holding both main's revision and this branch's optional displacement term on an effect. No tolerance was set and --tolerance-k was never passed. These numbers are a measurement and not a balance claim: release-plan.md forbids any balance claim before 0.5.0, and this file is evidence about one build rather than an assertion that the build is balanced. The universe remains degenerate in known ways -- among them that the three gates resolve zero raids, that no strategy in the pool submits god action 8 at any budget, and that no committed gate varies species or tradition -- so a metric that does not move here has not been shown to be inert, only to be out of this instruments reach.",
